Heat absorbed is Q = 54 \text{ cal} = 54 \times 4.184 \text{ J} \approx 225.9 \text{ J}
Expansion work is W = p \Delta V \approx 1.013 \times 10^{5} \times 167.1 \times 10^{-6} \text{ J}
